{
  "bookId": "rewind-50",
  "id": "chapter-207",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "41310001",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "潮酷街区，美术仓库外。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41310002",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "嘎吱——",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41310003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "库特",
          "text": "呼，嘿咻……啊，推开了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41310004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "库特",
          "text": "嘿嘿，和拉斐尔小姐一起准备画展这么久，推门我也已经很熟练了的说！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41310005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "拉斐尔",
          "text": "最近真的辛苦各位了……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41310006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "枣恭介",
          "text": "既然都加入了「Little Busters！月球漫步会！」，那就是同伴了，互相帮助才是同伴嘛！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41310007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "库特",
          "text": "是的，而且今晚「宇宙」画展可能也会吸引更多同伴加入我们的说！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41310008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "枣恭介",
          "text": "正是如此！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41310009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "孙尚香",
          "text": "那我们就赶紧开始干活吧！只剩最后的特别展品需要搬运了对吧？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41310010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "奇萝",
          "text": "咯咯是的，是我「精心」制作的外星人雕塑，一定能给所有人惊喜~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41310011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "拉斐尔",
          "text": "……总感觉是惊吓而不是惊喜呢。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41310012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "孙尚香",
          "text": "说起来，这个雕塑的颜色是不是和刚刚搬出来不一样了？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41310013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "库特",
          "text": "应该是颜料的原因，这个颜料是拉斐尔小姐特制的，会根据不同光线、角度变换颜色的哦。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41310014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "孙尚香",
          "text": "嗯~原来如此，还挺有意思的嘛。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41310015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "帕拉斯",
          "text": ">>>警告：雷达已发现可疑物体正在移动。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41310016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "又是那个雕塑……以登月航空器为中心，已发现多台雕塑。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41310017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "不排除人为陷阱的可能，需要尽快报告。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41310018",
          "sourceType": 13,
          "speaker": "凛",
          "text": "……原来如此，确实可疑。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41310019",
          "sourceType": 13,
          "speaker": "凛",
          "text": "我这边尽快和管理局联系，让他们对之前送过去的雕塑进行检查。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41310020",
          "sourceType": 13,
          "speaker": "凛",
          "text": "继续监视可疑雕塑，任何情况及时同步。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41310021",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "了解。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
      "id": "detail-1022",
      "sourceRefs": [
        {
          "bundle": "lbzhouju",
          "rowIds": [
            41310001,
            41310002,
